# An allowlist: only what the Dockerfile copies reaches the build daemon, so
# local databases, .env files and private notes never enter the context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/server/pyproject.toml
!packages/client/pyproject.toml
!packages/server/src/**
!packages/server/LICENSE
!NOTICE

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
